id: "oxp3:speaker-route"
version: 2026.10.29
name:
  zh: OXP3 扬声器路由与初始化恢复
  en: OXP3 speaker route and initialization recovery
description:
  zh: 在启动会话及休眠恢复后，确认 ALC245 耳机孔为空时修复误选的耳机路由；近期有 Speaker UCM 初始化失败日志时重选原扬声器配置。需要实际声音与耳机插拔验收。
  en: "After session start and resume, repairs a mistaken headphones route only when the ALC245 jack is empty. Retries the unchanged speaker profile after a recent Speaker UCM initialization failure. Physical audio and headset acceptance remain required."
compatibility:
  architectures[1]: x86_64
  os_ids[1]: steamos
  device_ids[1]: oxp3
  os_versions[1]: "3.10"
